OL,3,GNEWSABake Off star 'begged' for stand
OL,4,Amixer at Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Great British Bake Off contestant
OL,7,FMoyin Odeniran is currently studying
OL,8,Fpolitical economy, but as a 12-year-old
OL,9,Fhe was badgering his mum to buy him a
OL,10,Fstand mixer for Christmas.
OL,12,FThe 22-year-old from Essex would bake
OL,13,Fcakes and make pasta with his mum and
OL,14,Fsister back when he was a child, but he
OL,15,Fwanted more kit.
OL,17,FHe said: "I begged her, begged her for
OL,18,Flike a Christmas present and she was
OL,19,Flike 'you're not going to use it,
OL,20,Fyou're not going to use it' and I told
OL,21,Fher 'I promise you I'm going to use
OL,22,Fthis thing'."
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
